{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GL7d5n9mYGMfFHk5pHQu5g","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the discussions.md file.\\\\n\\\\nAccording to the discussions on **2026-02-20** (Window 36), the agreed-upon name of the new boolean config for GlobalKTable processing errors in the processing-exception-handler mechanism is:\\\\n\\\\n**`processing.exception.handler.global.enabled`**\\\\n\\\\nThis was proposed by Lucas Brutschy as a suggested config name change (noted as \\\\\\\"lb3\\\\\\\" in his feedback on 2026-02-20T09:41:00Z) in the context of KIP-1270: \\\\\\\"Introduce ProcessExceptionalHandler for GlobalThread\\\\\\\". The original proposed name was `default.processing.exception.handler.invoke.for.global`, but Brutschy suggested the simplified name `processing.exception.handler.global.enabled` instead.\\\\n\\\\n**Source**: `/store/discussions.md` (Window 36 section, 2026-02-19T17:09:45Z to 2026-02-20T20:46:20Z, KIP-1270 discussion)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":15.31,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":35773,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":29534,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0683793,\\\"input_tokens\\\":34,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1140}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"881f93d3-81c5-4015-a0ab-4d6e63c5f8e9","uuid":"ff4525e6-8011-4e66-8274-1cb2dd2b80ab","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:20:36.546Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the discussions.md file.\\\\n\\\\nAccording to the discussions on **2026-02-20** (Window 36), the agreed-upon name of the new boolean config for GlobalKTable processing errors in the processing-exception-handler mechanism is:\\\\n\\\\n**`processing.exception.handler.global.enabled`**\\\\n\\\\nThis was proposed by Lucas Brutschy as a suggested config name change (noted as \\\\\\\"lb3\\\\\\\" in his feedback on 2026-02-20T09:41:00Z) in the context of KIP-1270: \\\\\\\"Introduce ProcessExceptionalHandler for GlobalThread\\\\\\\". The original proposed name was `default.processing.exception.handler.invoke.for.global`, but Brutschy suggested the simplified name `processing.exception.handler.global.enabled` instead.\\\\n\\\\n**Source**: `/store/discussions.md` (Window 36 section, 2026-02-19T17:09:45Z to 2026-02-20T20:46:20Z, KIP-1270 discussion)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":15.31,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":35773,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":29534,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0683793,\\\"input_tokens\\\":34,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1140}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found the answer in the discussions.md file.\\n\\nAccording to the discussions on **2026-02-20** (Window 36), the agreed-upon name of the new boolean config for GlobalKTable processing errors in the processing-exception-handler mechanism is:\\n\\n**`processing.exception.handler.global.enabled`**\\n\\nThis was proposed by Lucas Brutschy as a suggested config name change (noted as \\\"lb3\\\" in his feedback on 2026-02-20T09:41:00Z) in the context of KIP-1270: \\\"Introduce ProcessExceptionalHandler for GlobalThread\\\". The original proposed name was `default.processing.exception.handler.invoke.for.global`, but Brutschy suggested the simplified name `processing.exception.handler.global.enabled` instead.\\n\\n**Source**: `/store/discussions.md` (Window 36 section, 2026-02-19T17:09:45Z to 2026-02-20T20:46:20Z, KIP-1270 discussion)\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"discussions.md\"],\"seconds\":15.31,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":2,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":35773,\"cache_write_tokens\":29534,\"cost_usd\":0.0683793,\"input_tokens\":34,\"outp